WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.594
Hi, I'm Thwart!

00:00:02.594 --> 00:00:05.834
Six agents had to outline every kernel on a corn photo.

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:07.602
With one skill, they all could.

00:00:07.602 --> 00:00:08.486
Here is how.

00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:13.918
Shrunk to the model's input, a small kernel is a speck.

00:00:13.918 --> 00:00:17.194
So the skill tiles the photo, keeps every mask, and has

00:00:17.194 --> 00:00:18.386
the agent review them.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.515
On the whole photo, SAM 3 finds no kernels.

00:00:24.407 --> 00:00:26.070
On a small region, eighty masks.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.010
The view was wrong, not the model.

00:00:29.592 --> 00:00:32.999
The planner tiles the photo, counts every request, and refuses if

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.238
it is over budget.

00:00:34.658 --> 00:00:37.744
SAM 3 runs on the whole photo, on coarse tiles with a

00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:39.544
grid of clicks, and on fine tiles.

00:00:39.964 --> 00:00:42.094
Every mask is saved before any filter.

00:00:43.164 --> 00:00:47.116
Selection drops masks cut by a tile edge, merges duplicates, and

00:00:47.116 --> 00:00:48.553
flags the suspicious ones.

00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:52.746
The agent reviews crops and records each decision with a reason.

00:00:52.746 --> 00:00:54.804
Then SAM 3 refines each kernel.

00:00:56.233 --> 00:00:57.703
One click is ambiguous.

00:00:58.822 --> 00:01:00.930
A click on a kernel also clicks the ear.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.144
So the skill adds negative clicks on neighbouring kernels.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.138
An update counts only if it agrees with the original.

00:01:08.717 --> 00:01:11.285
A public domain photo of corn cobs on a tray.

00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:15.841
The skill's model steps, with no agent review, proposed thirteen hundred and

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:18.254
ninety seven kernels in about three minutes.

00:01:18.254 --> 00:01:20.322
Nobody has checked them by hand.

00:01:21.842 --> 00:01:23.605
The agents differ in review.

00:01:23.605 --> 00:01:24.663
One skipped it.

00:01:24.663 --> 00:01:27.837
Haiku removed a hundred and eleven, including real kernels.

00:01:29.392 --> 00:01:32.053
The procedure does the heavy lifting, not the agent.

00:01:37.483 --> 00:01:39.474
Tile until the objects are big.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:40.801
Save every mask first.

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.129
Review with written reasons.

00:01:42.549 --> 00:01:44.590
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:45.173
I'm Thwart.

00:01:45.173 --> 00:01:45.465
Bye!
